---
import BrandLogo from './BrandLogo.astro';
import { productCopy } from './product-copy';
interface Props { questions: { q: string; a: string }[]; }
const { questions } = Astro.props;
const channels = [
  { id: 'whatsapp', name: 'WhatsApp' },
  { id: 'widget', name: 'Replaid widget' },
  { id: 'instagram', name: 'Instagram' },
  { id: 'messenger', name: 'Messenger' },
  { id: 'telegram', name: 'Telegram' },
] as const;
const guideUrl = '/docs/connect-your-agent/';
const registerUrl = 'https://app.replaid.pro/register';
---
<section class="start-hero" aria-labelledby="start-heading">
  <div class="start-hero-copy">
    <a class="hero-uneed start-award" href="https://www.uneed.best/tool/replaid" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span aria-hidden="true">★</span><strong>Voted #1 on Uneed</strong></a>
    <h1 id="start-heading">Your agent,<br /><span class="hero-highlight">ready to reply.</span></h1>
    <p>Connect a customer channel to the AI agent you already use. Let it send replies directly, or save drafts for review. You choose the permissions.</p>
    <div class="start-actions"><a class="sky-button" href={registerUrl}>Create your free account</a><a class="start-guide-link" href={guideUrl}>See the setup guide<svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5" /></svg></a></div>
    <p class="start-price-note">Founding Lifetime $299 · $50 usage credit for paid ops (WhatsApp, X) at provider price. <a href="/pricing/">See pricing</a>.</p>
    <a class="start-login" href="https://app.replaid.pro/login">Already have an account? Log in</a>
  </div>
  <figure class="start-preview" aria-labelledby="start-example-label">
    <figcaption id="start-example-label">Example: a direct reply</figcaption>
    <div class="start-message-card">
      <div class="start-message-source"><BrandLogo platform="instagram" /><span>Instagram<strong>A test message you send</strong></span><span class="start-unread" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
      <p>Hi! Are you open on Saturday?</p>
    </div>
    <div class="start-connection" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><div><img src="/favicon.svg" width="20" height="22" alt="" />Connected by Replaid</div><span></span></div>
    <div class="start-draft-card">
      <div class="start-draft-header"><span class="start-agent-avatar"><img src="/claude.svg" width="26" height="26" alt="" /></span><span>Your AI agent<strong>A reply based on your facts</strong></span><span class="start-draft-label">Sent</span></div>
      <div class="start-knowledge"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h10l4 4v14H5zM14 3v5h5M8 12h8M8 16h5" /></svg>From the opening hours you gave your agent</div>
      <p>Yes! We’re open on Saturday from 9am to 6pm.</p>
      <div class="start-draft-footer"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" /></svg>Sent directly. Sending permission enabled.</div>
    </div>
  </figure>
</section>
<section class="start-channels" aria-label="Available channels">
  <p>Choose one channel for your first test.</p>
  <ul>{channels.map(channel => <li><BrandLogo platform={channel.id} /><span>{channel.name}</span></li>)}</ul>
</section>
<section id="before-you-start" class="start-requirements" aria-labelledby="start-requirements-heading">
  <header><h2 id="start-requirements-heading">Have these ready.</h2><p>A small starting point is enough.<br />You can add more channels later.</p></header>
  <dl class="start-requirement-list">
    <div>
      <dt>Access to one channel</dt>
      <dd>A channel account you can manage, or a website where you can install the Replaid widget.
        <details class="start-channel-requirements"><summary>Check the channel requirements<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary><p>{productCopy.channelRequirements}</p></details>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Your own AI agent</dt>
      <dd>Use ChatGPT, Claude, Hermes Agent, or another client that supports external MCP connections. Replaid does not include an agent. <a href={`${guideUrl}#agent`}>Check the setup for your client and plan.</a></dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>One answer you can check</dt>
      <dd>Give your agent a few correct facts, such as your opening hours. Use a simple question to check that it uses those facts in the reply.</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</section>
<section id="first-reply" class="start-setup" aria-labelledby="start-setup-heading">
  <header class="start-section-heading"><h2 id="start-setup-heading">After sign-up,<br />start here.</h2><p>Open your Replaid team.<br />An owner or administrator connects the channel.</p></header>
  <ol class="start-steps">
    <li>
      <div class="start-step-art start-channel-art" aria-hidden="true"><span><BrandLogo platform="widget" /></span><i></i><span><img src="/favicon.svg" width="32" height="35" alt="" /></span></div>
      <h3><span>1</span>Connect one channel</h3><p>Open Channels in Replaid and connect your chosen channel. Send a new test message from your website or another account, then find it in Conversations.</p><a class="start-guide-link start-step-link" href={`${guideUrl}#channel`}>Channel setup<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5" /></svg></a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="start-step-art start-client-art" aria-hidden="true"><span><img src="/chatgpt.svg" width="38" height="38" alt="" /></span><span><img src="/claude.svg" width="38" height="38" alt="" /></span><span><img class="hermes-nous-logo" src="/hermes-agent-nous.png" width="43" height="43" alt="" loading="lazy" /></span></div>
      <h3><span>2</span>Connect your agent</h3><p>Add Replaid to your agent, sign in, and select your team. Give it the facts it needs to answer your test question.</p><a class="start-guide-link start-step-link" href={`${guideUrl}#agent`}>Agent setup<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5" /></svg></a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div class="start-step-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="start-rule-preview"><span>Send replies<b>✓</b></span><span>Save drafts<small>Optional</small></span></div></div>
      <h3><span>3</span>Choose how it replies</h3><p>In Agents → Policies, allow sending for direct replies, or allow drafts for review. Ask your agent to answer the test message using the permissions you selected.</p><a class="start-guide-link start-step-link" href={`${guideUrl}#draft`}>Optional draft setup<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5" /></svg></a>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="start-result" aria-labelledby="start-result-heading">
    <div><h3 id="start-result-heading">Check your first reply</h3><p>An answer based on your facts,<br />sent or saved as you choose.</p></div>
    <ul>
      <li><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>The reply appears in Conversations.</li>
      <li><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>The answer matches the facts you gave your agent.</li>
      <li><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>Your test account receives it, or it stays saved as a draft.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="start-questions" aria-labelledby="start-questions-heading">
  <header><h2 id="start-questions-heading">Before your<br />first connection.</h2><p>Account limits, message history,<br />and what happens after setup.</p><a class="start-guide-link" href="/contact/">Have another question?</a></header>
  <div class="sky-faq-list">{questions.map(faq => <details class="sky-faq-item"><summary><span>{faq.q}</span><svg class="sky-faq-toggle" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h12" /><path class="sky-faq-toggle-vertical" d="M10 4v12" /></svg></summary><p>{faq.a}</p></details>)}</div>
</section>
<section class="start-final" aria-labelledby="start-final-heading">
  <img src="/favicon.svg" width="36" height="39" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  <h2 id="start-final-heading">Ready to connect<br /><span class="hero-highlight">your agent?</span></h2>
  <p>Create your account, then follow the connection guide with your channel and agent ready.</p>
  <a class="sky-button" href={registerUrl}>Create your free account</a>
  <a class="start-guide-link" href={guideUrl}>Open the full connection guide</a>
</section>
